*> Acceptance test of docs/protocol/43-tint-sources.md section 6 (banner, map and other code-defined
*> colour users): 6.1 the banner layer order and the diffuse tint of each layer; 6.2 the packed map
*> id, the colour of every (base colour, brightness) pair of the 62 colours (NONE transparent,
*> undefined ids NONE, the byte masked to 0..255), V16, and the brightness choice with the worked
*> examples (IEEE double: divide first, then add the dither term).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-TINT-43-6.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
