 01 WS-EXPECTED-R REDEFINES WS-EXPECTED.
    05 WS-EXP              PIC X(8) OCCURS 248 TIMES.
 01 WS-PACKED              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-COLOUR              BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 WS-CASE                PIC X(240).
 01 WS-EXPECT              PIC X(8).
 01 WS-DYE                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ORDER               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DI                  PIC 999.
 01 WS-WATER               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DEPTH               BINARY-LONG.
